### Get country by code
GET http://localhost:8080/countries/IN


### Add country
POST http://localhost:8080/countries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "JP",
  "name": "Japan"
}


### Search country by name
GET http://localhost:8080/countries/search/Ind


### Update country
PUT http://localhost:8080/countries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "JP",
  "name": "Japan Updated"
}


### Delete country
DELETE http://localhost:8080/countries/JP